  "body": "Docker Hub was planning to sunset their free plan: https://www.docker.com/developers/free-team-faq/. Although they have backed down from doing this, it still seems better to centralize our infrastructure dependencies on GitHub.\r\n\r\nWattsi and html-build have been successfully published to the GHCR. This commit moves HTML's continuous integration step to depend on the GHCR version of html-build, instead of the Docker Hub version.",
